那你是Sam，伴郎吧？
And you're Sam, the best man?

963
00:51:21,160 --> 00:51:23,360
-嗨。  
-嗨，很高兴见到你。
-Hi.
-Hi, nice to see you.

964
00:51:26,793 --> 00:51:28,893
-我们不直接去教堂吗？  
-是啊，你…
-Are we not going
right to the church?
-Yeah, you...

965
00:51:28,927 --> 00:51:30,227
我们现在稍微早了点，
As we're a little bit early,

966
00:51:30,260 --> 00:51:32,360
显然你也不想提前到场，
and obviously
you don't want
to arrive early,

967
00:51:32,393 --> 00:51:36,260
我想我们走个稍微绕点、风景更好的路，
I thought we'd take a slightly
longer route, slightly scenic,

968
00:51:36,293 --> 00:51:38,227
好让你在合适的时间到达，
so that you can arrive
at an appropriate time

969
00:51:38,260 --> 00:51:40,860
顺便也能在路上好好享受一下这车。
and also enjoy the car
a little bit on the journey.

970
00:51:40,893 --> 00:51:44,993
