HAMMOND：不过，至少James开车还算稳当。
HAMMOND: Still, at least James
was driving sensibly.

973
00:51:52,893 --> 00:51:54,727
Sport，sport plus。
Sport, sport plus.

974
00:51:56,327 --> 00:51:59,593
我会让你准时抵达教堂的。
I will get you to
the church on time.

975
