I forgot about
the detail things.

1106
01:00:10,360 --> 01:00:12,993
抱歉那天我的情绪，实在不合时宜，
Sorry about my
mood on the day,
it was inappropriate,

1107
01:00:13,027 --> 01:00:14,627
结果就是这么回事。我们真的很抱歉。
as it turned out. We're sorry.

1108
01:00:14,660 --> 01:00:18,193
作为道歉和一点心意的象征，
By way of
an apology and as a token
of our appreciation,

1109
01:00:18,227 --> 01:00:21,960
我们给你们带来了这份纪念品，让你们记住这一天
we've brought you this memento
so you can remember the day

1110
01:00:21,993 --> 01:00:23,960
每次上厕所时都能想起。
every time you have a dump.

1111
01:00:23,993 --> 01:00:26,460
-(ALL LAUGHING)
-恭喜！
-(ALL LAUGHING)
-Congratulations!

1112
01:00:26,493 --> 01:00:29,193
-恭喜。 
-恭喜。
-Congratulations.
-Congratulations.

1113
01:00:29,760 --> 01:00:30,793
